                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Due to the press of time, neither the Seventh Session of the Commission on Human
                    Rights nor the Thirteenth Session of the Economic and Social Council was able to
                    address the question of self-determination.</p>
